OL,3,ATrump wants to 'destroy' Canada's auto
OL,4,Aindustry, Carney says of latest tariff
OL,5,Athreat
OL,6,
OL,7,FCarney confirmed he would match Trump's
OL,8,Ftariffs "dollar-for-dollar" from 8
OL,9,FSeptember, including levies on steel,
OL,10,Fdairy, appliances and electronics
OL,12,FBoth countries were optimistic of a
OL,13,Fdeal, but talks fell apart with each
OL,14,Faccusing the other of making
OL,15,Flast-minute changes
OL,17,FChief US trade negotiator Jamieson
OL,18,FGreer accused the Canadian side of
OL,19,Fwanting more in the deal
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
